# use flags used in the kde-sunset overlay

# LINGUAS flags declared by kde-apps/kde4-l10n and friends.  The main tree
# dropped them from its use.desc on 2017-12-27 (2dbbacd); this overlay keeps
# descriptions in the "<flag> - <description>" format.
