linguas_zh_TW - Chinese (Taiwan)

# dropped 2017-12-30
kontact - Enable support for the KDE personal information manager (kde-apps/kdepim*)

# dropped 2018-11-28
qt4 - Add support for the Qt GUI/Application Toolkit version 4.x
